title Fixly v2 - Fault Handling - Warranty, Repair and Replacement

Triage [color: orange, icon: alert-triangle] {
  Issue Raised [shape: oval]
  Check Warranty Status
  Assign Technician
  Technician Visits Site
  Diagnose
  Fixed On Site [shape: diamond]
  Close Issue
}

Warranty Path [color: green, icon: shield] {
  Warranty Valid [shape: diamond]
  Raise Warranty Claim
  Vendor Decision [shape: diamond]
  Vendor Sends Replacement
  Vendor RMA Repair
}

Paid Path [color: yellow, icon: dollar-sign] {
  Repair or Replace [shape: diamond]
  Cost Approval
}

Replacement [color: purple, icon: refresh-cw] {
  Replacement Request
  Approved [shape: diamond]
  Pick Spare from Client or Company or Platform Stock
  Stock Transfer to Site
  Technician Swaps Device
  New Device Installed and Active [shape: oval]
  Old Device Disposition [shape: diamond]
}

Repair [color: red, icon: wrench] {
  Create Repair Order
  Pickup and Transfer to Repair Center
  Repair Work
  Repaired [shape: diamond]
  QC and Return to Stock as Refurbished
  Back in Stock [shape: oval]
  Reinstall Same or Different Zone
}

End of Life [color: gray, icon: trash] {
  Retire Device
  Disposal with Data Wipe Certificate [shape: oval]
}

Issue Raised > Check Warranty Status
Check Warranty Status > Assign Technician
Assign Technician > Technician Visits Site
Technician Visits Site > Diagnose
Diagnose > Fixed On Site
Fixed On Site > Close Issue: Yes
Close Issue > New Device Installed and Active: Device stays Active
Fixed On Site > Warranty Valid: No

Warranty Valid > Raise Warranty Claim: In Warranty
Warranty Valid > Repair or Replace: Out of Warranty
Raise Warranty Claim > Vendor Decision
Vendor Decision > Vendor Sends Replacement: Replace
Vendor Decision > Vendor RMA Repair: Repair
Vendor Sends Replacement > Replacement Request
Vendor RMA Repair > Create Repair Order

Repair or Replace > Cost Approval
Cost Approval > Create Repair Order: Repair
Cost Approval > Replacement Request: Replace
Cost Approval > Retire Device: Not worth it

Replacement Request > Approved
Approved > Pick Spare from Client or Company or Platform Stock: Yes
Approved > Close Issue: Rejected
Pick Spare from Client or Company or Platform Stock > Stock Transfer to Site
Stock Transfer to Site > Technician Swaps Device
Technician Swaps Device > New Device Installed and Active
Technician Swaps Device > Old Device Disposition
Old Device Disposition > Create Repair Order: To Repair or Vendor RMA
Old Device Disposition > Retire Device: Scrap

Create Repair Order > Pickup and Transfer to Repair Center
Pickup and Transfer to Repair Center > Repair Work
Repair Work > Repaired
Repaired > QC and Return to Stock as Refurbished: Yes
Repaired > Retire Device: Beyond Repair
QC and Return to Stock as Refurbished > Back in Stock
Back in Stock > Reinstall Same or Different Zone: When needed
Reinstall Same or Different Zone > New Device Installed and Active

Retire Device > Disposal with Data Wipe Certificate
